#: Shape_Keys___Vertex_Groups_Utilities.py:2955
#: __init__.py:2972
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Reset the selected vertices (all, if none are selected) back to the Basis shape, on the marked keys or the active key."
msgstr "将选定顶点（若未选择则为全部）重置回 Basis 形态，作用于已标记的键或活动键。"

#: Shape_Keys___Vertex_Groups_Utilities.py:2954
