msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Reset to Basis"
msgstr "重置为 Basis"

#: Shape_Keys___Vertex_Groups_Utilities.py:5322
#: __init__.py:5339
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Resync this list with the actual shape keys. This is normally automatic; use it if a key looks missing or out of date."
msgstr "将此列表与实际形态键重新同步。通常会自动进行；若某个键看起来缺失或过期，请使用此项。"

#: Shape_Keys___Vertex_Groups_Utilities.py:3516
