msgid "Set the R and L suffixes used by the rename, swap and Separate Symmetrical tools."
msgstr "设置重命名、交换和分离对称工具使用的 R 和 L 后缀。"

#: Shape_Keys___Vertex_Groups_Utilities.py:3405
#: __init__.py:3422
