msgstr "设置顶点组重命名工具使用的 R 和 L 后缀。"

#: Shape_Keys___Vertex_Groups_Utilities.py:2256
#: __init__.py:2273
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Split the active shape key into a right and a left key. Select the vertices of either side in Edit Mode (-X is the right side, +X the left, in object space); the names use the R/L suffixes."
msgstr "将活动形态键拆分为右侧和左侧键。在编辑模式下选择任一侧的顶点（物体空间中 -X 为右侧，+X 为左侧）；名称使用 R/L 后缀。"

#: Shape_Keys___Vertex_Groups_Utilities.py:1457
#: __init__.py:1474
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Swap R/L Shape Keys"
msgstr "交换 R/L 形态键"

#: Shape_Keys___Vertex_Groups_Utilities.py:1458
#: __init__.py:1475
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Swap which side two marked keys are named for: the R key becomes L and the L key becomes R, each name keeping its driver. Needs exactly one of each, with names ending in the R/L suffixes (see Rename Tools settings)."
msgstr "交换两个已标记键所命名的侧：R 键变为 L，L 键变为 R，各名称保留其驱动器。需要每种各一个，且名称以 R/L 后缀结尾（参见重命名工具设置）。"

#: Shape_Keys___Vertex_Groups_Utilities.py:2624
