#: Shape_Keys___Vertex_Groups_Utilities.py:2644
#: __init__.py:2661
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Transfer Shape Key (nearest face)"
msgstr "传递形态键（最近面）"

#: Shape_Keys___Vertex_Groups_Utilities.py:2645
#: __init__.py:2662
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Transfer the marked shape keys (or the active one) of the other selected object onto the active object, as new keys with the same names. Each target vertex follows the nearest face of the source, so the meshes can differ (like Data Transfer's Interpolated Face). Keys that don't move the target are skipped."
msgstr "将其他选中物体上已标记的形态键（或活动形态键）以同名新键的形式传递到活动物体。每个目标顶点跟随源物体最近的面，因此网格可以不同（类似「数据传输」的插值面）。不会使目标发生移动的键将被跳过。"

#: Shape_Keys___Vertex_Groups_Utilities.py:1276
